  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Lot - 2 Construction of the Zvecan Sport Hall - relaunch</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The purpose of the contract is the construction of a new indoor sports hall in Zve&#xE7;an/Zve&#xBF;an designed to accommodate 640 spectators and enable indoor sports activities including basketball, handball, volleyball and futsal, a pedestrian sidewalk including installation of a new street lighting system in a section of the approach road to the sport hall from railways crossings of Zve&#xE7;an/Zve&#xBF;an to the village Zitkovc in Zve&#xE7;an/Zve&#xBF;an .&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
